(7351197, 1149593, 30490, '<td valign="top">This image took my breath away when I saw it! (I didn''t vote due to computer problems) Absolutely fabulous, and as always I appreciate your photographer''s notes.  I love hearing how you create these masterpieces.  <br/> <br/>The world is a cruel place, and all we can do is try to mitigate the horror with beauty, peace and love. Your photos help achieve that goal.</td>', 'This image took my breath away when I saw it! (I didn''t vote due to computer problems) Absolutely fabulous, and as always I appreciate your photographer''s notes.  I love hearing how you create these masterpieces.   The world is a cruel place, and all we can do is try to mitigate the horror with beauty, peace and love. Your photos help achieve that goal.', '2015-05-18 03:04:08.000000', NULL, 0),
