(7351336, 1149576, 19825, '<td valign="top">Beautiful depth and layers to the trees. Congrats on the ribbon. <br/> <br/>I go back and forth a bit on the hands -- but I love the concept. I wonder if lightly masking off the branches of the tree in the foreground would have helped -- making it look more like the ethereal hands were cradling the single tree. However, this would have been a more challenging processing feat to pull off. Regardless, the underlying image of the trees strong enough to carry things.</td>', 'Beautiful depth and layers to the trees. Congrats on the ribbon.  I go back and forth a bit on the hands -- but I love the concept. I wonder if lightly masking off the branches of the tree in the foreground would have helped -- making it look more like the ethereal hands were cradling the single tree. However, this would have been a more challenging processing feat to pull off. Regardless, the underlying image of the trees strong enough to carry things.', '2015-05-18 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351364, 1149606, 109227, '<td valign="top">You are so clever; great job, congrats!</td>', 'You are so clever; great job, congrats!', '2015-05-18 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351365, 1149562, 114969, '<td valign="top">I''m glad we agree on the commandment. Great message and composition, original and efficient. Congratulations on the red!</td>', 'I''m glad we agree on the commandment. Great message and composition, original and efficient. Congratulations on the red!', '2015-05-18 17:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351441, 1149402, 61552, '<td valign="top">With the drought in California, lawmakers are talking about charging us for ground water.  We have mineral rights out here and that includes water.  That means they want to regulate and restrict my use of ground water that I have the RIGHT to draw for my use.  If this god has a hand in our processes, I think he should be spending his time preventing the police from killing the citizens they''re sworn to protect.  Or stopping ISIS.  Or stopping slavery.  Or stopping acid rain.  Or stopping those molesting priests.<br/> <br/>Glad you like the image, it''s been accepted by Shutterstock.  Thank you!<br/> <br/></td>', 'With the drought in California, lawmakers are talking about charging us for ground water.  We have mineral rights out here and that includes water.  That means they want to regulate and restrict my use of ground water that I have the RIGHT to draw for my use.  If this god has a hand in our processes, I think he should be spending his time preventing the police from killing the citizens they''re sworn to protect.  Or stopping ISIS.  Or stopping slavery.  Or stopping acid rain.  Or stopping those molesting priests. Glad you like the image, it''s been accepted by Shutterstock.  Thank you! ', '2015-05-19 00:35:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351449, 1149593, 98565, '<td valign="top">Thank you - not only for this stunning composition but also for the accompanying words- you are so right!<br/></td>', 'Thank you - not only for this stunning composition but also for the accompanying words- you are so right!', '2015-05-19 02:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351450, 1149576, 114969, '<td valign="top">Trees can really be so majestic. Your surreal approach adds a touch of mysticism, which works beautiful with your b&amp;w conversion. It gives me motivation to take a walk in the forest and enjoy some more of these sights. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Trees can really be so majestic. Your surreal approach adds a touch of mysticism, which works beautiful with your b&w conversion. It gives me motivation to take a walk in the forest and enjoy some more of these sights. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2015-05-19 03:12:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351454, 1149644, 57224, '<td valign="top">This image is a juxtaposition of the finger and the Bible. For me the refusal of Christians to bake wedding cakes for Gay couples is very similar - a ludicrous juxtaposition that goes against everything that Jesus ever did in the short time he served mankind. :)<br/></td>', 'This image is a juxtaposition of the finger and the Bible. For me the refusal of Christians to bake wedding cakes for Gay couples is very similar - a ludicrous juxtaposition that goes against everything that Jesus ever did in the short time he served mankind. :)', '2015-05-19 06:25:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351467, 1149593, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the old masters mixed with Hudson river school lighting feel to this. Congrats again. Every little effort can change the world.</td>', 'I like the old masters mixed with Hudson river school lighting feel to this. Congrats again. Every little effort can change the world.', '2015-05-19 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351515, 1149602, 9780, '<td valign="top">emblisifingent!<br/></td>', 'emblisifingent!', '2015-05-19 15:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351520, 1149631, 135744, '<td valign="top">Nice atmosphere and composition. Looks like the horizon isn''t level - no worries if this is deliberate. I am not 100% sure if it should always be level:)</td>', 'Nice atmosphere and composition. Looks like the horizon isn''t level - no worries if this is deliberate. I am not 100% sure if it should always be level:)', '2015-05-19 15:53:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7351644, 1149562, 86447, '<td valign="top">I am SO GLAD this image did well!   It''s so lovely.<br/></td>', 'I am SO GLAD this image did well!   It''s so lovely.', '2015-05-19 21:18:54.000000', NULL, 0),
